{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4f26a63f-9122-8564-a539-790884ce9215",
  "created_at": "2025-12-30T11:45:56-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dennis Doyle",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:44:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:44:28-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, I'm calling about a streetlight. Hang on, let me put this down. Okay. There's a crosswalk near me that's totally dark, the light on the pole just isn't coming on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:44:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a streetlight that's out at a crosswalk. Where is that located?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:44:44-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's at 345 Kay Street. The pole is right by the crosswalk, in front of the house, more or less. Sorry, I'm carrying some boxes, um, one second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:44:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time. So that's 345 Kay Street, and the light by the crosswalk is out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:45:00-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Yeah. And it's pitch black there by about four-thirty now. I don't feel safe walking across, honestly. Cars come around the corner and I don't think they can see anybody."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:45:11-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That makes sense, especially this time of year. Do you know if it's completely out or does it flicker?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:45:18-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Completely out, as far as I can tell. I'd like a crew to come check the pole, if that's possible. I just moved here from Fall River, so I'm still learning the streets, I don't know if it's the right department even."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:45:32-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're in the right place, Public Works handles streetlights. I'll put in a request for a crew to check the pole at 345 Kay Street, by the crosswalk. Can I get a callback number in case they have questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:45:45-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0159."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:45:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-nine. Got it. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:45:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks for your help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T11:45:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Doyle. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
